OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785714477
OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FMore than one in 10 householders who
OL,7,Fare currently living with a hosepipe
OL,8,Fban do not intend to abide by it,
OL,9,Faccording to a survey.
OL,11,FSome 11% of households said they did
OL,12,Fnot intend to fully abide by the ban `
OL,13,Fwhile 5% said they did not yet know,
OL,14,Fthe YouGov poll of more than 4,200
OL,15,Fadults commissioned by the Press
OL,16,FAssociation found.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
