PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785714477
OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FSome 10% of householders said they
OL,7,Fwould report a neighbour using a hose
OL,8,Fin their garden while a ban was in
OL,9,Fplace and 71% said they would not,
OL,10,Fwith the remainder unsure.
OL,12,FSeven water companies ` Affinity
OL,13,FWater, Anglian Water, Cambridge Water,
OL,14,FSouthern Water, South East Water,
OL,15,FThames Water and South West Water `
OL,16,Fhave introduced the restrictions `
OL,17,Fofficially known as a "Temporary Use
OL,18,FBan" ` affecting 23 million customers,
OL,19,For around 40% of England's population.
OL,26,@yD@WOUzD@DO]
