OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FOverall, just half of households (49%)
OL,7,Fsaid they supported a hosepipe ban in
OL,8,Ftheir local area, while 35% said they
OL,9,Fopposed the restrictions.
OL,11,FA significant number of responses from
OL,12,Fthose polled involved the belief that
OL,13,Fthose on a meter should be able to use
OL,14,Fas much water as they needed because
OL,15,Fthey were paying for it.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
