CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785714477
OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FA drip irrigation system for a garden
OL,7,Fis also allowed as long as it is
OL,8,Ffitted with a timer and pressure-
OL,9,Freducing valve and delivers water
OL,10,Fdirectly to the soil rather than
OL,11,Fspraying it into the air.
OL,13,FThe ban does extend to using a
OL,14,Fhosepipe to clean a car or fill a
OL,15,Fpaddling pool or domestic swimming
OL,16,Fpool.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
