OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FOther householders raised concerns
OL,7,Fabout their water supplier's wider
OL,8,Fperformance, with one saying: "I pay
OL,9,Fan extortionate amount for my water.
OL,10,FIt is not my problem that water
OL,11,Fcompanies would rather give their CEOs
OL,12,Fridiculous amounts of money instead of
OL,13,Fbuilding new reservoirs."
OL,15,FAnother said: "How does a first world
OL,16,Fnation not have the infrastructure to
OL,17,Fsupport no rain for a month?"
