OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FThe bans come as almost a third of
OL,7,FEngland ` including parts of the South
OL,8,FEast, Midlands and North West `
OL,9,Flanguish in "prolonged dry weather"
OL,10,Fstatus, with only the North East and
OL,11,FYorkshire still seeing "normal"
OL,12,Fconditions for the time of year.
OL,14,FLast week, the Environment Agency
OL,15,Fdeclared seven areas of central,
OL,16,Feastern and southern England ` around
OL,17,Fhalf of the country ` as officially in
OL,18,Fdrought as a result of very low
OL,19,Frainfall and high temperatures.
OL,26,@qD@MOUqD@cO]sD@XOUsD@_O]
