OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,FLast year, Yorkshire Water reported
OL,7,Fsavings of up to 10% in household
OL,8,Fconsumption when their hosepipe ban
OL,9,Fwas in place, while Anglian Water has
OL,10,Freported a 9% reduction in demand
OL,11,Fsince its ban was implemented last
OL,12,Fmonth.
OL,14,FA Water UK spokeswoman said: "We are
OL,15,Fincredibly grateful to customers for
OL,16,Fdoing their bit to protect our
OL,17,Fenvironment and preserve our water
OL,18,Fsupplies.
OL,26,@vD@^OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
