OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,F"Some parts of the country have seen
OL,7,Fdemand for water rise by more than a
OL,8,Fthird.
OL,10,F"Water companies are working round the
OL,11,Fclock fixing leaks, moving water
OL,12,Facross regions and running treatment
OL,13,Fworks flat out to keep supplies
OL,14,Fflowing, and we urge all customers to
OL,15,Fuse water wisely."
OL,17,FAn Environment Agency spokeswoman
OL,18,Fsaid: "A hosepipe can use 1,000 litres
OL,19,Fan hour ` which is more than a family-
OL,20,Fof-four will use in a day.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUwD@RO]zD@GOU
