OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,F"These short-term bans allow companies
OL,7,Fto conserve their supplies as we don't
OL,8,Fknow when this drought will end.
OL,10,F"We are grateful to people for
OL,11,Ffollowing the restrictions, where in
OL,12,Fplace. The less water we use, the more
OL,13,Fstays in the local environment, which
OL,14,Fis vital for the health of our rivers
OL,15,Fand wildlife."
