OL,3,CMore than one in 10 householders do
OL,4,Cnot intend to abide by hosepipe ban
OL,6,F"However, asking customers to play
OL,7,Ftheir part means water companies must
OL,8,Fbe playing theirs too. Water saving is
OL,9,Fa shared responsibility and when
OL,10,Fcustomers see their water company
OL,11,Ffailing to get a grip on leakage, it
OL,12,Funderstandably drains their own
OL,13,Fmotivation to save water."
